        rdfs:comment "The Element is a plan, guideline or strategy how to create, perform or analyze an application."@en .

    <https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/test> a owl:NamedIndividual,
            ns7:SoftwarePurpose ;
